1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,630
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,790
♪All worldly pursuits are fleeting
dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,350
♪Sorrow fades away, resentment fades
away♪

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,870
♪Anger and grudges are but passing
clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,640
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:30,150
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,230
♪This humble monk wanders freely across
the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,430
♪Laughing and fooling around, yet bound
by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,950
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,110
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,230
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit of
wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,580
♪But in the end, all things simply pass
by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,350
♪Better to follow the heart and find
true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,550
♪Don't let worldly troubles bind your
soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,190
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,870
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,430
♪With my worn-out fan in hand, I care
not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,750
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,510
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,910
♪Simple robes and straw sandals beat
fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,070
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple fan
is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,470
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot of
wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through me, but
kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,030
♪I cling not to appearances, finding
freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,070
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,540
♪I see life's joys and sorrows in a
single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,150
♪Those who harm the good and abuse their
power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,630
♪Do good and cultivate virtue, and
worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,990
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,750
♪True cultivation lies in a joyful
heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,870
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:52,990
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,380
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 4=

34
00:01:57,540 --> 00:02:00,340
Three-Headed Jiao has been sealed
inside the Linglong Pagoda.

35
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:02,580
He can no longer undergo a tribulation.

36
00:02:02,580 --> 00:02:04,900
If he can't become a true dragon,

37
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:06,980
we'll turn him into a demon dragon.

38
00:02:06,980 --> 00:02:07,860
What?

39
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:21,060
Huh?

40
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:23,780
Why'd it get dark?

41
00:02:23,940 --> 00:02:25,140
My savior!

42
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,180
It's me.

43
00:02:26,420 --> 00:02:28,540
I found a way to get you out.

44
00:02:28,540 --> 00:02:30,260
Just hang in there a little longer.

45
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:32,380
In here,

46
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:34,500
it's much nicer than outside.

47
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,820
Li Jing doesn't want
Nezha to suffer in here.

48
00:02:36,820 --> 00:02:38,860
This pagoda has everything I need.

49
00:02:38,860 --> 00:02:40,780
It's cool in summer and warm in winter.

50
00:02:41,780 --> 00:02:43,020
I'm sunbathing.

51
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:43,980
You're blocking the sunlight.

52
00:02:43,980 --> 00:02:44,620
Move over.

53
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:45,060
Oh.

54
00:02:48,660 --> 00:02:49,620
Move over a little more.

55
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:50,540
Huh?

56
00:02:52,580 --> 00:02:53,180
Hey.

57
00:02:53,420 --> 00:02:54,020
Perfect.

58
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:56,660
If I weren't in a hurry to save my wife,

59
00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:58,700
I'd gladly stay here forever.

60
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:00,300
Wait.

61
00:03:00,820 --> 00:03:01,820
Where's my wife?

62
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:03,420
She...

63
00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:05,580
She's a little hurt.

64
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:06,100
My wife?

65
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:07,620
Is it serious?

66
00:03:09,020 --> 00:03:09,820
She's fine.

67
00:03:09,820 --> 00:03:11,060
It's just a minor injury.

68
00:03:11,220 --> 00:03:11,740
My savior,

69
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:13,220
I'll bring you two human hearts.

70
00:03:13,220 --> 00:03:14,620
Eat them,

71
00:03:14,820 --> 00:03:16,620
and you'll become a demon dragon

72
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:17,660
and break out of the pagoda.

73
00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:19,580
Then you can see your wife again.

74
00:03:20,180 --> 00:03:21,140
Eat human hearts?

75
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:22,820
Wouldn't that make me a monster?

76
00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:27,300
Oh.

77
00:03:28,540 --> 00:03:29,380
Right. I am one.

78
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:30,620
True dragon

79
00:03:30,620 --> 00:03:31,260
or demon dragon,

80
00:03:31,580 --> 00:03:32,860
if it can save my wife,

81
00:03:33,060 --> 00:03:34,500
I'll eat anything.

82
00:03:34,580 --> 00:03:37,060
Mr. Huang in Lin'an is a greedy man.

83
00:03:37,460 --> 00:03:38,780
I'll go take his heart now.

84
00:03:39,020 --> 00:03:41,340
Acting rashly will ruin our chance.

85
00:03:41,580 --> 00:03:43,740
Wait until his greed reaches its peak.

86
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:46,020
Only then can we take his heart.

87
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:48,300
Who are you?

88
00:03:48,460 --> 00:03:50,180
I'm Lingyu, a spirit bird

89
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:51,500
with 1,000 years of cultivation.

90
00:03:52,220 --> 00:03:54,020
I'm on my way to get revenge on him.

91
00:03:54,420 --> 00:03:55,220
Why don't

92
00:03:56,780 --> 00:03:57,940
we join forces?

93
00:04:04,980 --> 00:04:06,260
(Linglong Pagoda
Gen, Kan, Qian)

94
00:04:08,220 --> 00:04:09,940
You seem quite fond of

95
00:04:10,660 --> 00:04:11,380
your savior.

96
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:14,420
He saved my life.

97
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:16,460
Of course he means everything to me.

98
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:19,500
From the look on your face,

99
00:04:20,060 --> 00:04:21,260
something must've happened

100
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:23,460
to his wife.

101
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:25,780
A monk killed her.

102
00:04:25,940 --> 00:04:27,500
I was afraid he'd do something rash,

103
00:04:27,660 --> 00:04:28,780
so I lied to him.

104
00:04:31,420 --> 00:04:33,100
What will you do when he finds out

105
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:34,660
you lied?

106
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:37,180
As long as he regains his freedom

107
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:39,100
and frees the fox clan,

108
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:40,540
even if he kills me,

109
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:41,620
I'll have no regrets.

110
00:04:45,860 --> 00:04:47,100
What a foolish girl.

111
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:50,700
When wild spirits and demons die,

112
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:52,060
they all go to Youming City.

113
00:04:52,980 --> 00:04:54,340
If she's lucky,

114
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:56,860
the City Lord hasn't enslaved her yet.

115
00:04:58,540 --> 00:05:00,140
I can escort you to Youming City.

116
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:01,620
As for

117
00:05:02,340 --> 00:05:03,620
whether you can bring her back,

118
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:05,020
that depends on your luck.

119
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:08,260
What?

120
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:10,620
Afraid your rival will come back

121
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:12,060
and steal your savior away?

122
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:14,420
I'm trying to help you.

123
00:05:14,580 --> 00:05:15,460
Forget it if you don't want my help.

124
00:05:21,580 --> 00:05:22,700
Shoot!
[*Pun, means "I'll go".]

125
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:24,340
Fine.

126
00:05:35,060 --> 00:05:36,060
Where am I?

127
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:37,660
Who's there?

128
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:39,500
Who dares trespass in Youming City?

129
00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:40,780
Where did you come from, demon?

130
00:05:41,820 --> 00:05:42,140
I...

131
00:05:42,820 --> 00:05:44,380
I'm just a lowly demon.

132
00:05:44,940 --> 00:05:46,140
Immortal,

133
00:05:46,700 --> 00:05:49,220
may I ask where I am?

134
00:05:50,380 --> 00:05:51,660
This is Youming City.

135
00:05:53,180 --> 00:05:54,980
My father is the Lord of Youming City...

136
00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:56,820
The City Lord!

137
00:05:57,500 --> 00:05:58,780
I mean... his subordinate.

138
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:01,380
(I hear Youming City lies
outside the Three Realms.)

139
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:03,260
(The City Lord holds exalted status,)

140
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:05,140
(on par with Shakyamuni Buddha.)

141
00:06:05,420 --> 00:06:07,340
(If I can make a life for myself here,)

142
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:09,140
(I'd rise to the top overnight.)

143
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:11,540
What an honor to meet you, Immortal.

144
00:06:11,780 --> 00:06:12,940
Would you

145
00:06:12,940 --> 00:06:16,100
take pity on a helpless woman

146
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:19,580
and show me a thing or two?

147
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:25,460
In that case,

148
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:26,860
come home with me.

149
00:06:27,100 --> 00:06:29,140
We can get better acquainted.

150
00:06:31,780 --> 00:06:32,780
Let go of her!

151
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:35,780
It's you.

152
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:36,860
Why are you here?

153
00:06:37,340 --> 00:06:37,740
I...

154
00:06:40,380 --> 00:06:42,260
My savior is trapped
in the Linglong Pagoda.

155
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:43,700
He can't stop worrying about you.

156
00:06:43,900 --> 00:06:45,020
I came all this way to save you.

157
00:06:45,380 --> 00:06:45,660
Hmph.

158
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,260
If he's trapped,

159
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:48,340
why would I go back now?

160
00:06:50,460 --> 00:06:52,700
Now that I've met you, Immortal,

161
00:06:53,660 --> 00:06:56,740
of course I should stay by your side.

162
00:06:59,020 --> 00:07:00,580
My savior truly loves you.

163
00:07:00,940 --> 00:07:01,980
To cure your illness,

164
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:03,180
he risked a heavenly tribulation.

165
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:04,780
How can you treat him like this?

166
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:05,700
Illness?

167
00:07:08,140 --> 00:07:09,740
I was never sick.

168
00:07:10,340 --> 00:07:12,620
I wanted him to become a true dragon

169
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:15,380
so I could live a life of luxury.

170
00:07:15,940 --> 00:07:18,140
Turns out he's a total loser.

171
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:19,100
What?

172
00:07:19,780 --> 00:07:20,260
You...

173
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:22,460
Save it.

174
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:24,020
I don't have time for your nonsense.

175
00:07:25,340 --> 00:07:26,380
Immortal,

176
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:28,380
on a beautiful night like this,

177
00:07:28,700 --> 00:07:32,220
don't let her spoil our fun.

178
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:33,940
All right.

179
00:07:33,940 --> 00:07:35,700
I'll take you home.

180
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:43,140
(Patrol)

181
00:07:45,220 --> 00:07:45,900
I can't believe

182
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:48,220
she'd rather be with a lowly city guard

183
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:50,340
than go back to my savior.

184
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:52,060
Alas.

185
00:07:52,780 --> 00:07:55,620
Even my guard has a beauty beside him,

186
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,780
but I'm still all alone.

187
00:07:59,780 --> 00:08:00,620
Alas.

188
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:05,260
Hey, beautiful.

189
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:08,860
May I ask...

190
00:08:08,980 --> 00:08:10,140
are you married?

191
00:08:10,540 --> 00:08:11,300
You creepy old pervert!

192
00:08:14,940 --> 00:08:16,580
Am I really that bad?

193
00:08:19,820 --> 00:08:20,820
Alas.

194
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:22,560
(Mahavira Hall)

195
00:08:25,580 --> 00:08:26,420
Bixu!

196
00:08:27,780 --> 00:08:28,620
Master!

197
00:08:28,620 --> 00:08:30,260
Bixu is hanging himself!

198
00:08:30,660 --> 00:08:32,100
Bixu!

199
00:08:33,660 --> 00:08:35,260
Shh!

200
00:08:37,540 --> 00:08:39,180
I've missed you so much!

201
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:41,180
Bixu, calm down!

202
00:08:41,180 --> 00:08:43,300
Bixu!

203
00:08:44,100 --> 00:08:45,380
I've missed you so much!

204
00:08:46,660 --> 00:08:47,340
Biqing?

205
00:08:47,820 --> 00:08:48,140
Hey!

206
00:08:48,220 --> 00:08:48,780
Hey!

207
00:08:51,380 --> 00:08:52,220
Grandmaster,

208
00:08:52,220 --> 00:08:54,100
you're the abbot now?

209
00:08:54,100 --> 00:08:54,500
Mm.

210
00:08:54,940 --> 00:08:55,500
Oh.

211
00:08:55,500 --> 00:08:56,700
Since you left,

212
00:08:56,700 --> 00:08:58,660
- things have really changed.
- Mm.

213
00:08:58,660 --> 00:08:59,980
I am the abbot now,

214
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:02,540
- but he's not overseer anymore.
- Mm.

215
00:09:03,700 --> 00:09:05,620
- Not anymore?
- Not anymore.

216
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:09,820
What's wrong?

217
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:12,060
Oh!

218
00:09:12,060 --> 00:09:13,100
My...

219
00:09:13,100 --> 00:09:14,220
My dear Abbot!

220
00:09:14,380 --> 00:09:15,420
What are you doing?

221
00:09:15,860 --> 00:09:16,580
You...

222
00:09:16,580 --> 00:09:17,780
You're not overseer anymore.

223
00:09:17,780 --> 00:09:18,820
Keep your distance from me.

224
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:19,980
Hey!

225
00:09:20,060 --> 00:09:20,580
Oh!

226
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:21,220
Hey!

227
00:09:21,380 --> 00:09:23,260
You betrayed me!

228
00:09:23,260 --> 00:09:23,820
What?

229
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:24,660
You betrayed me!

230
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:25,980
- Hey!
- Master!

231
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:28,380
I'm the one who loves you most!

232
00:09:28,380 --> 00:09:30,900
Why are you breaking my heart?

233
00:09:33,100 --> 00:09:34,140
Hold on, Master!

234
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:34,900
Lift your leg!

235
00:09:34,900 --> 00:09:35,620
That's it.

236
00:09:35,780 --> 00:09:37,060
- We're here.
- Oh!

237
00:09:37,060 --> 00:09:37,700
Master.

238
00:09:37,940 --> 00:09:39,140
How did you get hurt?

239
00:09:39,300 --> 00:09:40,820
Did Three-Headed Jiao hurt you?

240
00:09:42,100 --> 00:09:42,580
Stop!

241
00:09:43,620 --> 00:09:44,580
This is all your fault!

242
00:09:44,580 --> 00:09:46,900
- I-I...
- You gave Master that stolen pagoda!

243
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:49,020
It got him struck by lightning!

244
00:09:49,020 --> 00:09:49,580
No, no!

245
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:51,620
Master Bala gave me the pagoda.

246
00:09:51,620 --> 00:09:52,700
It had nothing to do with me!

247
00:09:52,700 --> 00:09:53,500
Exactly.

248
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:54,900
Come back.

249
00:09:54,900 --> 00:09:56,260
She can't hold on much longer.

250
00:09:58,100 --> 00:09:59,220
She's tiny, but she's strong.

251
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,260
Master.

252
00:10:01,700 --> 00:10:04,340
Thank goodness for the Linglong Pagoda.

253
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:06,340
It trapped the Three-Headed Jiao

254
00:10:06,660 --> 00:10:09,100
and saved us from disaster.

255
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:09,740
Alas.

256
00:10:09,900 --> 00:10:10,700
No!

257
00:10:11,220 --> 00:10:12,780
I'd rather Biqing betray me

258
00:10:12,780 --> 00:10:14,100
than I betray Biqing!

259
00:10:14,180 --> 00:10:16,260
I'm taking back the overseer job!

260
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:19,260
Ah!

261
00:10:19,260 --> 00:10:19,620
Hey!

262
00:10:19,620 --> 00:10:20,660
Hey, hey!

263
00:10:20,660 --> 00:10:21,060
What?

264
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:22,180
What are you doing?

265
00:10:22,180 --> 00:10:22,500
Hey.

266
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:23,060
Where's the money?

267
00:10:23,260 --> 00:10:24,660
You didn't make a cent?

268
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:25,420
Hey!

269
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:27,460
I was busy saving Lin'an City.

270
00:10:27,460 --> 00:10:30,420
When was I supposed to make money?

271
00:10:30,420 --> 00:10:31,020
Oh, please.

272
00:10:31,020 --> 00:10:33,500
Plenty of crooked doctors "save lives"

273
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:35,260
while bleeding patients dry.

274
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:36,940
Why don't you learn from them?

275
00:10:36,940 --> 00:10:39,060
Just charge ten times as much

276
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:40,340
for your Kick-and-Stare Pills.

277
00:10:40,340 --> 00:10:41,140
Hey, fat monk.

278
00:10:41,300 --> 00:10:42,380
It's only been one day.

279
00:10:42,660 --> 00:10:43,300
What's the rush?

280
00:10:43,500 --> 00:10:43,860
Hey.

281
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:44,980
Two days.

282
00:10:45,260 --> 00:10:47,140
Only two days till the end of the month.

283
00:10:47,140 --> 00:10:48,980
If you can't come up with 500 taels,

284
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:50,860
give the overseer job back to me,

285
00:10:50,860 --> 00:10:52,540
or I'll throw you out.

286
00:10:52,780 --> 00:10:54,100
You...

287
00:10:54,100 --> 00:10:55,660
Hey!

288
00:10:55,660 --> 00:10:56,140
Master!

289
00:10:56,140 --> 00:10:57,380
Hang in there!

290
00:10:57,620 --> 00:10:59,580
You can't lose to that fat monk!

291
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:00,540
Okay?

292
00:11:01,060 --> 00:11:02,020
Hang in there!

293
00:11:02,020 --> 00:11:02,700
Stay strong!

294
00:11:03,660 --> 00:11:04,100
Oh.

295
00:11:04,540 --> 00:11:05,100
Let's go.

296
00:11:05,780 --> 00:11:06,340
- Hey!
- Come on!

297
00:11:06,340 --> 00:11:07,020
Where are we going?

298
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:11,500
To collect alms!

299
00:11:11,500 --> 00:11:12,540
Oh.

300
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:16,620
What goes around comes around.

301
00:11:16,620 --> 00:11:17,460
Fatty.

302
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:17,860
Hmph.

303
00:11:18,060 --> 00:11:19,620
Looks like it's come around already.

304
00:11:20,060 --> 00:11:20,380
Hmph.

305
00:11:20,740 --> 00:11:23,660
Alms, please!

306
00:11:24,380 --> 00:11:25,460
He's really getting into character.

307
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:27,780
- Abbot!
- Yes?

308
00:11:27,900 --> 00:11:29,340
- Can we go too?
- Sure.

309
00:11:29,580 --> 00:11:30,780
- Go away.
- Hey!

310
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:31,980
Come on, let's go.

311
00:11:32,140 --> 00:11:32,860
Abbot!

312
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:34,340
Come on!

313
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:37,740
Master!

314
00:11:37,940 --> 00:11:38,900
Stop!

315
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:40,100
Within two days,

316
00:11:40,540 --> 00:11:43,380
I'll take back the overseer job!

317
00:11:45,940 --> 00:11:47,700
Master!

318
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:54,020
Holy Monk,

319
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:55,020
please have some tea.

320
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:55,500
Thank you.

321
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:57,020
I'll get Mr. Huang right away.

322
00:11:57,660 --> 00:11:58,820
- Please wait.
- Sure.

323
00:11:59,140 --> 00:11:59,700
Thank you.

324
00:12:01,420 --> 00:12:02,660
Wow, Holy Monk.

325
00:12:02,660 --> 00:12:03,900
Mr. Huang's home

326
00:12:03,900 --> 00:12:05,420
really lives up to its reputation.

327
00:12:05,580 --> 00:12:06,980
It's nothing special.

328
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:10,060
Once Master works his magic,

329
00:12:10,300 --> 00:12:12,540
that 500 taels is as good as ours.

330
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:14,780
Then that fat monk can admit defeat.

331
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:16,260
Right.

332
00:12:17,900 --> 00:12:20,220
That's a strong evil aura.

333
00:12:20,580 --> 00:12:21,100
Oh!

334
00:12:21,900 --> 00:12:23,740
It's an honor to welcome the Holy Monk

335
00:12:23,740 --> 00:12:24,860
from Lingyin Temple.

336
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:26,300
Amitabha Buddha.

337
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:29,340
- Buddha appeared a few days ago.
- Mm.

338
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:31,020
He promised us triplets.

339
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:32,140
Holy Monk,

340
00:12:32,140 --> 00:12:33,700
are you here to bless us with children?

341
00:12:34,780 --> 00:12:35,900
Well...

342
00:12:36,780 --> 00:12:39,020
I hear your son is attracted to men.

343
00:12:39,220 --> 00:12:40,180
Then you should know

344
00:12:40,380 --> 00:12:42,220
two men can't have kids.

345
00:12:44,300 --> 00:12:46,700
But I already paid 1,600 taels.

346
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:48,420
Now, now. Don't worry.

347
00:12:48,420 --> 00:12:49,340
I sense

348
00:12:49,340 --> 00:12:50,740
a very strong evil aura here.

349
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:53,140
Maybe the evil aura got to your son

350
00:12:53,140 --> 00:12:54,860
- and clouded his mind.
- Mm.

351
00:12:55,140 --> 00:12:55,860
What's more,

352
00:12:56,300 --> 00:12:57,340
I can also see

353
00:12:57,540 --> 00:12:59,020
that you and your younger son

354
00:12:59,220 --> 00:13:00,380
are both marked for disaster.

355
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:01,180
Within three days,

356
00:13:01,180 --> 00:13:02,540
disaster will strike.

357
00:13:02,540 --> 00:13:03,460
- What?
- Huh?

358
00:13:04,220 --> 00:13:05,140
Ah.

359
00:13:05,460 --> 00:13:06,820
But don't worry.

360
00:13:08,060 --> 00:13:09,700
We've prepared

361
00:13:09,700 --> 00:13:10,940
my secret remedy,

362
00:13:10,940 --> 00:13:12,940
the Kick-and-Stare Pill.

363
00:13:12,940 --> 00:13:15,020
It melts in your mouth,
not in your hand.

364
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:15,900
Take it,

365
00:13:15,900 --> 00:13:17,780
and the evil aura won't affect you.

366
00:13:19,700 --> 00:13:20,100
Hey.

367
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:21,700
And that's not all.

368
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:23,380
It'll make you stronger

369
00:13:23,380 --> 00:13:24,780
and help you live longer.

370
00:13:25,260 --> 00:13:25,980
Then

371
00:13:25,980 --> 00:13:28,500
Mr. Huang Jr. can have
a whole bunch of children!

372
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:29,260
That's right.

373
00:13:29,260 --> 00:13:30,020
If it works,

374
00:13:30,020 --> 00:13:32,020
- Mm.
- then make a temple offering.

375
00:13:40,140 --> 00:13:43,100
You swindled me out of 1,600,

376
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:45,380
and now you're peddling more lies!

377
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:46,380
No, no!

378
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:48,060
- You want me to pay to eat mud?
- No!

379
00:13:50,380 --> 00:13:51,340
You frauds!

380
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:53,220
Within three days,

381
00:13:53,220 --> 00:13:55,940
return my 1,600.

382
00:13:56,300 --> 00:13:56,900
Otherwise,

383
00:13:57,660 --> 00:13:59,140
I'll report you to the authorities.

384
00:13:59,140 --> 00:14:00,580
- He can't see a good thing!
- Someone!

385
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:01,500
Throw them out!

386
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:02,060
Yes, sir.

387
00:14:02,060 --> 00:14:02,900
Move!

388
00:14:02,900 --> 00:14:04,420
Mr. Huang, wait!

389
00:14:04,420 --> 00:14:05,540
- It's a miracle cure!
- Move!

390
00:14:05,540 --> 00:14:06,500
- Get out!
- Look!

391
00:14:06,500 --> 00:14:07,340
You're not welcome here.

392
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:07,780
Go!

393
00:14:07,780 --> 00:14:08,340
Hey!

394
00:14:09,980 --> 00:14:10,420
Hmph.

395
00:14:11,420 --> 00:14:12,500
Oh, no!

396
00:14:13,380 --> 00:14:14,980
My top-grade Tieguanyin!

397
00:14:15,340 --> 00:14:16,300
You fool!

398
00:14:16,300 --> 00:14:17,940
You served them my finest tea!

399
00:14:21,060 --> 00:14:22,300
Take the tea money out of your wages.

400
00:14:22,580 --> 00:14:24,260
Huh? My wages?

401
00:14:24,580 --> 00:14:25,820
I refuse to believe

402
00:14:26,020 --> 00:14:27,700
the Huang family line ends with me.

403
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:28,740
Hmph.

404
00:14:29,420 --> 00:14:30,460
Spread the word.

405
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:31,460
Find my son a bride.

406
00:14:31,780 --> 00:14:32,900
Tell that good-for-nothing son of mine

407
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:35,260
- to marry and have kids.
- Yes.

408
00:14:35,260 --> 00:14:36,260
Otherwise,

409
00:14:36,260 --> 00:14:38,100
I'll throw him out of the Huang family.

410
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:39,540
Yes, sir.

411
00:15:03,140 --> 00:15:04,740
That mad monk

412
00:15:05,220 --> 00:15:07,500
could actually sense the evil aura.

413
00:15:08,060 --> 00:15:10,900
Good thing he didn't find my treasure.

414
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:13,180
Hmph.

415
00:15:15,180 --> 00:15:17,340
Since his wife never truly loved him,

416
00:15:18,060 --> 00:15:19,540
doesn't that give you your chance?

417
00:15:25,460 --> 00:15:26,300
What...

418
00:15:26,780 --> 00:15:29,340
What did Mr. Huang do to you?

419
00:15:34,060 --> 00:15:36,460
We have a blood feud.

420
00:15:37,380 --> 00:15:38,620
Oh!

421
00:15:38,620 --> 00:15:40,540
My treasure!

422
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:45,020
Oh!

423
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:53,750
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

424
00:15:54,100 --> 00:15:56,950
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

425
00:15:57,080 --> 00:16:00,750
♪Everything I own is worn and
weathered♪

426
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:03,830
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

427
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:07,720
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

428
00:16:07,721 --> 00:16:10,990
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

429
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:14,550
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

430
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:24,470
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

431
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:27,710
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

432
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:31,030
♪After the wedding, I became an
immortal♪

433
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:32,710
♪I thought of the Arhat who subdued the
tiger♪

434
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,630
♪And there he was, right by my side, oh
my♪

435
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:36,190
♪I left my wife behind♪

436
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,790
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

437
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:41,630
♪Living a life of hiding here and
running there♪

438
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:42,750
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

439
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:44,870
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

440
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:46,550
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

441
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:48,430
♪Waiter, bring me a plate of chicken
wings♪

442
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:51,790
♪People laugh and say I'm lost and
foolish♪

443
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:55,070
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

444
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:58,190
♪His endless lectures come from worry
I'll cause trouble♪

445
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:01,550
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

446
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:05,230
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

447
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:08,590
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

448
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:11,670
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

449
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:15,310
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

450
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:18,750
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

451
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:22,310
♪You chase fame and fight over fortune
and fate♪

452
00:17:22,320 --> 00:17:25,790
♪You're just wasting your time♪

453
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:28,750
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

454
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,430
♪And I just laugh happily♪

455
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:33,830
♪Wishing joy and happiness for all in
this world♪

456
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:46,110
♪People laugh and say I'm lost and
foolish♪

457
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:49,510
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

